WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.168
Emily:
Sometimes when I write,

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:02.794
Emily:
I lose control.

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:05.505
♪♪

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:08.800
Only you would show up at a
party...

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:10.469
...looking like a raccoon.

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:12.638
I'm not here for the party.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:14.306
Come on, I need to know-
-Emily...

00:00:14.306 --> 00:00:16.600
What did you think of my poems?
Tell me!

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.601
I loved them.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.978
♪♪

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.855
Sue:
I always love your poems,

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.857
but I can't be your only reader
anymore.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.235
You need to share your writing
with the world.

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:29.571
♪♪

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:31.156
Sue: There's someone that I need
you to meet.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.784
♪♪

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:34.910
Sue:
Sam Bowles.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.912
Sue: This could be the man to
put you in the spotlight.

00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:39.039
♪♪

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.749
I'm always interested in hearing
a new voice.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:43.210
♪♪

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.211
Emily:
What if I don't want...

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.046
Emily:
...fame?

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:49.049
How do you want to be
remembered?

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.260
♪♪

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.470
I'm thrilled that I could bring
the two of you together.

00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:54.680
Emily:
Feels like...

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.722
♪♪

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.723
Emily:
...destiny.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.808
It is so crazy...

00:00:57.808 --> 00:00:59.142
...Sue is an influencer.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.644
♪♪

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:02.437
I don't want to disappear from
this Earth...

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:03.730
...without anybody knowing who I
am.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.731
♪♪

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:06.984
Does anybody else have any
intentions?

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.986
The witches of Salem walked so
we could run.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.070
(Lightning crashes)
(Gasping)

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.573
♪♪

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.616
Emily:
Sometimes when I write...

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:15.826
Emily:
...I lose control.

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:18.161
♪♪

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.038
You're about to become world
famous overnight.

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.164
♪♪

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.582
Your aura is negative right now.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:25.002
Emily: I used to have this
confidence...

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:26.920
Emily:
...but not since I met him.

00:01:27.129 --> 00:01:28.505
What a crazy day this is.

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:30.549
Not as crazy as what's going on
up here.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:31.925
She's so extra.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:35.804
♪♪

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:37.514
Emily: If you could put your
name on what you wrote,

00:01:37.514 --> 00:01:38.432
♪♪

00:01:38.432 --> 00:01:39.224
would you?

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.100
Who wouldn't?

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:40.976
♪♪

00:01:40.976 --> 00:01:42.644
This is the opportunity of a
lifetime.

00:01:43.186 --> 00:01:44.354
Emily:
You pressured me into this.

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:45.605
I don't even recognize you!

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:46.648
♪♪

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:47.441
Nobody: I think it's kinda like...

00:01:47.441 --> 00:01:49.443
♪♪

00:01:49.443 --> 00:01:50.444
Nobody:  ...Death.

00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:51.486
What's up, girl?

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:53.739
♪♪

00:01:53.739 --> 00:01:55.991
Emily: Part of me is pretty sure
that fame isn't good for me.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:58.118
♪♪

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.911
Emily: In fact, I think it could
be very dangerous.

00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:02.956
♪♪ Welcome to the dark side ♪♪

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.250
♪♪

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.418
Whoa!
-What?

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:08.587
It's like your brain is on fire.

00:02:08.587 --> 00:02:09.796
Oh, that tracks.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:12.382
♪♪

